From 7368e28179344727d8552610536523adca70b10e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 03:30:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Postgres string concat, merge CauHoiDTO, implement stub
 DAL methods

- LopHocDAL: replace SQL Server-style `+` string concatenation with `||`
  (3 queries failed on PostgreSQL: "operator does not exist: varchar + unknown"),
  which broke the student "Lop hoc" tabs.
- Remove duplicate DAL/CauHoiDTO; use Models.CauHoi everywhere. The grid is
  bound to List<CauHoi> but the click handler cast to CauHoiDTO (always null),
  so selecting a question never filled the edit form.
- DeThiDAL: implement XoaCauHoi (blocked when answers exist), SuaCauHoi and
  LayKetQuaTheoDeThi, which previously returned fake true / an empty table.
- frm_GiaoVien: bind result grid columns (DataPropertyName) and handle the
  delete-question exception.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EjpmnwinkVm4f1iLTaTUkK
